{"ref":"BDB, אֱלִישֶׁ֫בַע","hw":"אֱלִישֶׁ֫בַע","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֱלִישֶׁ֫בַע</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.f. (</strong><em>God is an oath</em>, by which one swears, cf. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 19:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.19.18\">Is 19:18</a> <a data-ref=\"Amos 8:14\" href=\"/Amos.8.14\">Am 8:14</a> <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 1:5\" href=\"/Zephaniah.1.5\">Zp 1:5</a><strong>)</strong> wife of Aaron <a data-ref=\"Exodus 6:23\" href=\"/Exodus.6.23\">Ex 6:23</a>; = Ἐλεισαβεθ 𝔊, cf. Lu <a data-ref=\"Exodus 1:5\" href=\"/Exodus.1.5\">1:5</a>.","next":"BDB, אֱלִישׁוּעַ","prev":"BDB, אֶלְיָקִים"}